{
  "ghi_chu": "Me co dai (Phase 12C, doi 1). CHEP KHUNG `trung_co_2`: dat, cay, nguoi, do vat giu nguyen. Nha KayKit mau do NHUOM lai bang `mau_cot` (hang dem tu duoi len, bang mau 8x4): o 1,0 mai do -> rom vang, o 2,3 nen da xanh xam -> dat nau, o 1,3 trat sang -> dat set. Nha vang/lam/luc doi sang ban do cung hinh roi nhuom chung - doi 1 moi mai la rom. Ba cong trinh doi han bang model Icosa (CC-BY, ghi cong o `data/ghi_cong.json`): Trai linh -> dau truong (cVtCnH0tnHJ), Lo nung -> thap Sumer (09R_9_0WVVf), Nha bia -> den Hy Lap (cdMQnl19MB9). Model Icosa khong dat goc o tam nen phai bu `x`/`y`/`z` = -(tam hop bao) * ti_le. Tai: ban luu web.archive.org dut 27/09, lay ban `backblazeb2` qua `api.icosa.gallery`. Phai nuong cung so trang, `o_px`, `heSo` voi `trung_co_2`.",
  "ghi_chu_trang": "Tu 19/09 me nay can HAI trang atlas o co 2x: ba khung coi xay (`coi_xay_k0/k1/k2`) day tong dien tich sprite tu 84,4% len 90,2% mot trang, khong xep vua nua. Moi me phai ra cung so trang nen `hien_dai` dem mot trang rong 1x1 cho bang.",
